Modifications by sd133cn (2026):

- a userspace WireGuard backend (wireguard-go) with a self-healing watchdog,
  so the stack also runs on hosts whose kernel has no WireGuard module
  (verified on Synology DSM with kernel 4.4.302+);
- an offline deployment path: prebuilt images plus
  docker-compose.release.yml, for machines with no outbound internet access.
